## Acknowledgement

This project is a standalone, independent wrapper around the pinned
upstream Hermes Web UI project (see `../UPSTREAM.md` in the umbrella
checkout this was developed alongside). The upstream project's own code is
never vendored, copied, or redistributed by this wrapper — it is imported
in-process from its own separate, unmodified checkout at run time.

The transport adapter in `hermes_webui_wrapper/transport/handler.py` is
adapted directly from `api_adapter.py` in the parent checkout (MIT
License, Copyright (c) the Hermes WebUI project and contributors). That
upstream file's copyright and license terms are acknowledged here in full;
this wrapper's copy is a derivative adaptation of that MIT-licensed source
(bridging the same stdlib `BaseHTTPRequestHandler`-shaped surface onto
this wrapper's own ASGI runtime), not merely an independent work "in the
spirit of" it.
